Police Station: Whitefield, Bengaluru East      FIR No.: 0871/2026

Complaint received on 12th Jan 2026 (Monday).

Complainant Ms. Divya Menon (age 29) of Prestige Shantiniketan states that her Honda Activa KA 03 MN 8899 was taken by her ex-colleague Arjun Rao on 9th January 2026 for a day and has not been returned. He is not answering calls on 7760 334 455. She had earlier transferred Rs 15,000/- to Arjun's PhonePe 7760334455@ybl as security. Her friend Kavya Nair can confirm this. Kindly register a case under Section 316(2) BNS.

Recorded by: HC Manjunath Gowda
